{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぅおりゃぁーーーーーーー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/24/6096955/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"聞いてくれー能條のおたけびをーーーっっっ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあさ、今日は久々のOFFだったわけよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからさ、いつものようにぐーたらパンタコパンダのように眠るのではなく、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さっそうと起きて！そしてバッチリメイクしてな？（いつもよりルージュは赤め）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪の毛もそれなりにセットしてな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"服きてな？まあ女子力ってやつのつもりで香水をシュッとつけてな？（ちなみにトミーガール）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美容院へ行こうと（お世話になってますMARIS）思ってな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ルンッルンで電車乗って向かってたらさ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"車内アナウンスにて「ただいま震度4の地震があったため運転見合わせ......」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おぉれぇぇぇぇいいいっっっっ！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地震だと？？気づかなかったがこれじゃあギリギリの予約の時間に間に合わないじゃないか！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"焦る焦る......どうする能條どうする！？！？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"電車の中の人々は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わりかしみんな焦ってない。。余裕な顔。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うわーこの電車乗ってる人達のなかでこんだけ焦ってんのあみだけだ絶対。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......うーん......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ......もういいや......。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"予約の時間も過ぎたし目一杯買い物してやろう！！！目キラキラ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってなわけで原宿で服と靴下をそれなりに買ってやった！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっふぅーやってやったぜ能條！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"別に美容院行けなかったからってなんの悔いもないぜっ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ないぜ。。。いやちょっとある。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/24/6096955/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"近っ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして昨日......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあタイトルにも書いてあるように、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日のロケ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっと17年間生きてきたなかで一番、過酷だったんじゃないかなと。。思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなロケのオンエア、楽しみに待っててくあさい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/24/6096955/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このポーズ好きだな笑"}],"source":"archive"}